---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — AASRA" description="How we collect, use, and protect your data.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:720px;">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 2026</p>
      <p>AASRA collects your name, email, phone, city, and address to process and ship your order. We do not store card data — payments are handled by our payment gateway on a secure hosted checkout.</p>
      <h3>Who we share data with</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Payment gateway (to process your payment)</li>
        <li>Courier (to deliver your order)</li>
        <li>Transactional email provider (for order emails)</li>
        <li>Cloudflare (hosting, security, analytics)</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Your rights</h3>
      <p>You may request correction or deletion of your data. Email us at orders@example.com.</p>
      <p>This is a summary policy. Replace with full legal text reviewed by a lawyer before launch.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
